/*
  RecentlyUnlockedAchievements.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 dashboard widget · 0080 · RecentlyUnlockedAchievements (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `RecentlyUnlockedAchievementsWidget` resolves (table "RecentlyUnlockedAchievements")
  lives here with its web `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the
  app `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without editing
  the shared catalog (parallel-unsafe across the concurrent slots).

  The first block is the exact set of keys rendered by the web source
  (features/dashboard/widgets/RecentlyUnlockedAchievements.tsx, the shared
  features/analytics/components/AchievementBadge.tsx it renders, and
  registry/analytics.ts). The remaining keys back the native-only chrome (freshness
  chip, retry/loading/error copy, connectivity banners).
*/

